  "worked_solution": "We factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{e}^{2}-16{f}^{2} & = \\\\ (2e)^{2}-(4f)^{2} & = \\\\ (2e-4f)(2e+4f) & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
